    "statement": "Online image copies hold one pinned source read snapshot across page batches, finish the driver-owned destination before releasing the source, and release source handles before verification. Live backup retains its bounded BUSY/LOCKED retry policy; restore reports its first step failure. Integrity probes report integrity_check, quick_check and foreign_key_check results without deciding promotion. Current-state hashing includes persistent schema definitions and typed, length-framed table rows in binary order, excluding only store_revision row content, not its schema. Store adapters retain destination admission, cleanup, manifests, migration and promotion policy."
